			"title": "Client events ingested vs dropped",
			"description": "Browser telemetry throughput: accepted events (ktb_client_events_total) vs rejected (ktb_client_events_dropped_total). A widening gap with flat traffic means the client SDK or ingest validation is rejecting payloads.",
